  "title": "Nvidia faces leadership vacuum amid alleged spy and AI issues, with interim CEO Colette Kress urging staff to move forward",
  "summary": "Nvidia faces a potential leadership vacuum as its CEO, Jensen Huang, resigns after an alleged extramarital affair with a Singapore-based executive, while also facing allegations of a relationship with an alleged Chinese spy. The company is exploring whether such an affair could influence its dealings with AI technology and global supply chains. Colette Kress, the interim CEO, urges employees to move forward and offers pay raises after the departure.",
